# macOS 15.6 (24G84) OS volume, desktop tier (2026-11-11): nearly the whole system volume, as
# ventura-desktop.list does for 13.5, generated from 15.6's own /System/Library listing.
# Left out by build-macos-root.sh (MAXFILE): every file over 16 MiB, listed in $W/skipped-desktop.txt.
# Left out here: /System/Library/{Extensions,DriverExtensions,KernelCollections,Kernels,PrelinkedKernels}
# (kexts, dexts and Apple kernels: our kernel loads none), /System/iOSSupport (Catalyst resources;
# their code is in the cache), /System/DriverKit. Framework code lives in the shared cache (SystemOS
# cryptex), so this is executables, plists and resources. --thin keeps only arm64e slices.
